+# Research Report — Organizational alternatives to standing offices
+
+- **Topic:** Design and evidence basis of organizational alternatives to standing offices: compare standing offices vs temporary mission cells; what evidence would make the latter worth testing; alternatives that preserve independence.
+- **Office:** Executive Innovation Office (temporary research agent; research-only).
+- **Read-only:** canonical town `/var/lib/lubko/wd/viche`, the constitutional mount, viche-state. Writes only `records/research/2026-11-23-org-experiment-design-research.md` in this worktree. No branches/commits, no law, no ballots, no deployment.
+- **Date:** 2026-11-23.
+- **Scope note:** experimental design only — no concrete bills, no new law proposals, no implementation. Conversion of any finding to law is up to Parliament (precedents: Act 2 §2 "Parliament can establish permanent offices, appoint non-parliamentary officers"; Act 14; Act 25; Act 29; Act 32).
